{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>PlantNotes 是一款離線優先的植物日記與照顧排程工具，適合多肉植物收藏者、家居園藝愛好者，以及希望認真記錄每株植物成長點滴的使用者。程式不設社交動態，亦毋須註冊帳戶，照片、照顧記錄與開支帳目全部存放於裝置之上。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-9.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>獨立排程與開支記錄</h2>\n<p>可為每株植物設定澆水與拍照間隔，每日自動整理待辦清單，一按完成打卡並推算下次提醒。植物檔案記錄品種、種植方式與擺放位置，並以生長中、休眠或送贈等狀態歸檔。內置開支帳目記錄花盆與肥料支出，並提供六個月照顧頻率圖表，亦可連接 AI 助手解答疑難。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-11-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-12-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-13-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-14-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-15-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：PlantNotes</li><li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/plantnotes/id6826112516?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:01.905265+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":309,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T03:27:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T05:59:33.782270+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:44.236097+00:00","content_hash":"2513ffb57aad14f088c1b552c8a4b4f77570a2d11c2095958185c4895e3665ed","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}